---
---
<section id="inicio" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-head">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow reveal">Santa Quitéria · Curitiba</p>

      <h1 class="hero-title reveal" style="--delay:60ms">
        <span class="hero-title__lead">A SAVE está de</span>
        <span class="hero-title__turn">casa nova.</span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-body">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="lead reveal" style="--delay:120ms">
          De clínica a hospital veterinário, a SAVE acaba de mudar para Santa Quitéria.
        </p>
        <p class="body-copy reveal" style="--delay:160ms">
          O cuidado continua o mesmo, agora em uma casa maior e pensada para o seu pet.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions reveal" style="--delay:200ms">
          <a href="https://wa.me/5541996665808" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Falar no WhatsApp
            <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="#novo-hospital" class="btn btn-secondary">Conheça o novo hospital</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-figure reveal" style="--delay:160ms">
        <div class="hero-figure__media">
          <img
            src="/media/companheiros-save.webp"
            alt="Cão e gato juntos, representando o cuidado da SAVE com os animais"
            width="1120"
            height="560"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
